{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-cellselectionstate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: CellSelectionState"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type CellSelectionState = CellSelectionRange[];","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/cell-selection/cellSelectionFeature.types.ts#L41","children":[{"type":"text","value":"features/cell-selection/cellSelectionFeature.types.ts:41"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ordered range operations that produce the final selection. The last entry is\nthe active operation that shift-extend and drag operate on."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A bare array, matching "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"SortingState"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ColumnFiltersState"},{"type":"text","value":". Drag session\nstate deliberately lives outside this slice as non-reactive instance data, so\nnothing here is transient and the whole slice is safe to persist."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-cellselectionstate","text":"Type Alias: CellSelectionState","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: CellSelectionState\n\n```ts\ntype CellSelectionState = CellSelectionRange[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/cell-selection/cellSelectionFeature.types.ts:41](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/cell-selection/cellSelectionFeature.types.ts#L41)\n\nOrdered range operations that produce the final selection. The last entry is\nthe active operation that shift-extend and drag operate on.\n\nA bare array, matching `SortingState` and `ColumnFiltersState`. Drag session\nstate deliberately lives outside this slice as non-reactive instance data, so\nnothing here is transient and the whole slice is safe to persist.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: CellSelectionState\ntitle: CellSelectionState\n---\n\n# Type Alias: CellSelectionState\n\n```ts\ntype CellSelectionState = CellSelectionRange[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [features/cell-selection/cellSelectionFeature.types.ts:41](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/features/cell-selection/cellSelectionFeature.types.ts#L41)\n\nOrdered range operations that produce the final selection. The last entry is\nthe active operation that shift-extend and drag operate on.\n\nA bare array, matching `SortingState` and `ColumnFiltersState`. Drag session\nstate deliberately lives outside this slice as non-reactive instance data, so\nnothing here is transient and the whole slice is safe to persist.\n"}
